    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so my electric water heater in the kitchen is making this weird loud knocking sound every now and then. also the water isnt getting as hot as it used to, its just kind of lukewarm. what could be causing that? do i need a plumber ASAP?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
